13
01:05:43,333 --> 01:05:49,333
100 Tears is a 2007 American independent black comedy slasher film directed
by Marcus Koch and written and co-produced by Joe Davison.

14
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
It follows the story of a circus clown going on a murderous
rampage after being wrongfully accused of rape.

15
01:15:50,000 --> 01:15:56,000
The film stars Georgia Chris, Joe Davison (who also produced the film), Jack Amos,
and Raine Brown, and was distributed by Anthem Pictures in 2007.

16
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
The film was generally well received by independent horror film
critics and has since garnered a cult following.

17
01:25:56,666 --> 01:26:02,666
The tone is dark.
